                                                "sense_id": "1b9dec14-2711-31cb-ab69-27eb659f48d2",
                                                "text": "\"The video was posted on and being reposted by pro-Wagner channels, which matches Prigozhin's 'Fire Shojgu' narrative...Also some Wagner patches are visible on it. Nearly all 'poor mobiks' (mobilized men) on the video wear balaclavas,\" Krutov wrote."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f73f061b-421f-4c11-98a8-6d625cca52e7",
                                                "sense_id": "1b9dec14-2711-31cb-ab69-27eb659f48d2",
                                                "text": "The Defense Ministry has pumped out a stream of videos showing happy \"mobiks,\" as the recruits are known in Russian slang, learning to shoot, attack tanks, tie a tourniquet, plant a land mine and other military tasks."
                                            }
